use firn/tags

clojure is a Module
clojure is tagged lisp

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.clojure.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.unstable.clj-kondo, pkgs.unstable.clojure-lsp, pkgs.unstable.jet, pkgs.unstable.cljfmt]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."clojure"."enable": enable "Clojure tooling — LSP, linting, formatting (native binaries, no JVM)"
